title: Not done, and what I am unsure of.
pid: eb048456-cb1c-4402-8a75-1567e9e6b0d0
body: |2-
  - A replaced root keeps the containers folder of the node it replaced, its members drawn noWarrant; switching back makes them warranted. Jeff may mind.
  - Each press now draws the view once per candidate author; nothing measured that on Jeff's large views.
  - An author whose overrides apply only beneath a node another perspective puts in place joins the cycle only from that perspective.
  - Editing from a foreign author's perspective forks as anywhere, and the redraw shows that author's version again, unedited (as under a foreign root); documented, not changed.
  - Top is named "claude-public's", or whichever of Top's skgrepos Jeff's config declares first; Jeff may want names of people, which the config does not hold.
